T*
(Event vector order:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- [difficultyScore, difficultyScore, durationScore, priceScore, trailScore, distanceScore,) Tj
T*
(  elevationScore]) Tj
T*
(Formula: cosine = dot\(user, event\) / \(||user|| * ||event||\), clamped to 0..1.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Because this compares the direction of the vectors, cosine similarity can stay fairly high) Tj
T*
(even if one parameter is low, as long as the overall shape is similar.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5\) WORKED EXAMPLE \(STEP BY STEP\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(User preferences:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Experience = Intermediate, Preferred difficulty = Intermediate, Duration = 6 hrs, Budget =) Tj
T*
(  PHP 2,000 - 3,000, Trail type = Forest, Distance = 12 km, Elevation = 800 m.) Tj
T*
(Event details:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Difficulty = Technical, Duration = 8 hrs, Price = PHP 3,500, Trail type = Rocky, Distance) Tj
T*
(  = 10 km, Elevation = 1,200 m.) Tj
T*
(Per-parameter percents:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Experience vs difficulty: gap = 1 \(Intermediate -> Technical\), percent = 1 - 1/3 = 0.667) Tj
T*
(  \(66.7%\).) Tj
T*
(- Preferred difficulty vs difficulty: same calculation = 0.667 \(66.7%\).) Tj
T*
(- Duration: 1 - |8 - 6| / 8 = 0.750 \(75.0%\).) Tj
T*
(- Budget: cap = 3000; price = 3500 -> 3000/3500 = 0.001 \(0.1%\).) Tj
T*
(- Trail type: Forest vs Rocky -> 0.000 \(0.0%\).) Tj
T*
(- Distance: 1 - |10 - 12| / 12 = 0.833 \(83.3%\).) Tj
T*
(- Elevation: 1 - |1200 - 800| / 1200 = 0.667 \(66.7%\).) Tj
T*
(Match score = average of the seven percents = 0.512 \(51.2%\).) Tj
T*
